[Term]
id: GO:0072238
name: metanephric long nephron development
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of a metanephric long nephron over time, from its formation to the mature structure. Long nephrons are associated with juxtamedullary glomeruli and extend into the inner medulla in the metanephros." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
synonym: "metanephric juxtamedullary nephron development" RELATED [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
