[Term]
id: GO:0072270
name: metanephric short nephron development
namespace: biological_process
def: "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of a short nephron in the metanephros over time, from its formation to the mature structure. Short nephrons are associated with mid-cortical and superficial glomeruli, are situated entirely in the outer medulla, and have no thin ascending limb." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
