[Term]
id: UBERON:0000353
name: parenchyma
namespace: uberon
def: "Functional part of an organ in the body. This is in contrast to the stroma, which refers to the structural tissue of organs, being exactly, connective tissues." [Wikipedia:Parenchyma]
