id: UBERON:0001105
name: clavicle bone
namespace: uberon
def: "A paired dermal or endochondral bone that is part of the pectoral girdle. The clavicle may be in contact with the interclavicle or coracoid and forms an attachment site for pectoral musculature. [PHENOSCAPE:ad]." [https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/103, PHENOSCAPE:ad]
