relationship: located_in UBERON:0001844 ! cochlea
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001849 {source="FMA"} ! membranous labyrinth
property_value: depicted_by http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/Gray923.png xsd:anyURI
property_value: editor_note "we follow the FMA in placing this in the membranous labyrinth. Notes: The labyrinth can be divided by layer or by region. Bony vs. membranous / Vestibular vs. cochlear" xsd:string

