property_value: UBPROP:0000003 "It is suggested that the mammalian lamina ascendens arose from an upgrowth of the root of the quadrate ramus of the epipterygoid in cynodonts, separating foramen rotundum from foramen ovale.[well established][VHOG]" xsd:string {date_retrieved="2012-09-17", external_class="VHOG:0001543", ontology="VHOG", source="PMID:1018003 Presley R, Steel FLD, On the homology of the alisphenoid. Journal of Anatomy (1976)", source="http://bgee.unil.ch/"}
