[Term]
id: UBERON:0005777
name: glomerular basement membrane
namespace: uberon
def: "The layer of extracellular matrix that lies between the endothelium of the glomerular capillaries and the podocytes of the inner or visceral layer of the Bowman capsule; it is a fusion of the endothelial cell and podocyte basal laminas and acts as a physical barrier and an ion-selective filter." [MGI:anna, MP:0011348]
