intersection_of: UBERON:0013685 ! foramen of skull
intersection_of: conduit_for UBERON:0001532 ! internal carotid artery
relationship: conduit_for UBERON:0001532 ! internal carotid artery
relationship: part_of UBERON:0001678 ! temporal bone
property_value: depicted_by http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Gray141.png xsd:anyURI

