[Term]
id: UBERON:0009879
name: tarsal skeleton
namespace: uberon
def: "Subdivision of skeleton that consists of endochondral elements distal to the zeugopodial skeletal elements which constitute the proximal region of the posterior autopod skeleton[PHENOSCAPE:ad]." [https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/94, PHENOSCAPE:ad, VSAO:0005024]
subset: pheno_slim
