name: lymph node germinal center light zone
namespace: uberon
def: "Lymph node germinal centers contain two microenvironments: the light zone and the dark zone. The light zone is sparsely populated with B cells and includes additional cell types such as follicular dendritic cells, lymph node tingible macrophages and T follicular helper cells." [http://orcid.org/0000-0003-4183-8865/, PMID:25656706, PMID:8011279]
